## Port workflow (per task)

1. Open Linear issue + disk plan + wireframe under `docs/real-estate/`.
2. Read matching kit file(s) under `mdeai-design-system/…` — structure, testids, state machine.
3. Implement **new** React in `src/app/host/rentals/**` and `src/components/host/rentals/**`.
4. Reuse existing mdeapp patterns — extend `host-nav-rail.tsx`, don't fork a second nav system.
5. Class **U** proof + preserve testids before Done.

